        OST is the digital cash made for every citizen of the world — 
        private, instant, and connected to any currency you already have.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#revolution" class="btn btn-primary btn-glow">
          <span class="btn-spark"></span>Try the Pay Demo
