  <!-- ================================================================== -->
  <!-- 2. OUR STORY -->
  <!-- ================================================================== -->
  <section id="story" class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-decor">
        <div class="float-orb float-orb-1"></div>
        <div class="float-orb float-orb-2"></div>
      </div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Our Story</h2>
      <div class="manifesto">
        <p class="manifesto-lead">
          Bitcoin showed us that when money belongs to the people, it becomes unstoppable.
        </p>
        <p>
          For the first time in human history, ordinary citizens — not governments, 
          not banks, not any single institution — created a currency that works across every 
          border, every timezone, every language. That was the spark. That spark changed everything.
        </p>
        <p>
          But Bitcoin was the beginning, not the destination. Sending it is slow and expensive 
          for daily shopping. Your balance is visible to anyone who looks. And billions of people 
          still can't use it easily for the simple things that matter most — paying rent, 
          buying groceries, sending money to a parent in another country.
        </p>
        <p><strong>OST is the next chapter of that revolution.</strong></p>
        <p>
          We took the unstoppable heart of Bitcoin and gave it everything a real global citizen 
          needs: transactions that settle in under a second, privacy that hides your balance and 
          payments from the world using zero-knowledge proofs, and bridges so seamless that your 
          existing money — Bitcoin, Ethereum, dollars, euros, pesos, rials, naira — can flow into 
          OST in a single click.
        </p>
        <p>
          We are building for the fruit seller in Lagos and the engineer in Tehran. For the 
          grandmother in São Paulo and the student in Jakarta. For the artist in Moscow and the 
          teacher in Karachi. For every single human being who deserves to send, receive, and 
          hold money without asking permission from anyone.
        </p>
        <p>
          Some people call us dreamers. We call ourselves builders. And this is what we're building: 
          a universal digital cash that belongs to no country and serves every citizen. Privately. 
          Instantly. Equally.
        </p>
        <p class="manifesto-closing">
          Welcome to OST. Welcome home.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================================================================== -->
  <!-- 3. FOR EVERY CITIZEN — Cultural Cards -->
  <!-- ================================================================== -->
  <section id="citizens" class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title">For Every Citizen</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        No borders. No exceptions. OST works for every person, every culture, every economy.
        One humanity, one money.
      </p>
      <div class="citizen-grid">

        <div class="citizen-card culture-china">
          <div class="culture-bar"></div>
          <div class="citizen-flag">🇨🇳</div>
          <h3>China</h3>
          <p class="culture-tagline">Ancient tradition meets digital innovation</p>
          <p>From the Silk Road to the blockchain — China's 5,000 years of trade history meets private digital cash. Send money home without surveillance.</p>
          <div class="culture-symbols">🏮 🐉 ⛩️</div>
        </div>

        <div class="citizen-card culture-india">
          <div class="culture-bar"></div>
          <div class="citizen-flag">🇮🇳</div>
          <h3>India</h3>
          <p class="culture-tagline">A billion dreams, one borderless currency</p>
          <p>From Mumbai's markets to Kerala's backwaters — affordable remittances and private savings for 1.4 billion people. No bank account required.</p>
          <div class="culture-symbols">🪷 🕉️ 🎆</div>
        </div>

        <div class="citizen-card culture-nigeria">
          <div class="culture-bar"></div>
          <div class="citizen-flag">🇳🇬</div>
          <h3>Nigeria</h3>
          <p class="culture-tagline">Leading Africa's financial revolution</p>
          <p>Africa's most crypto-savvy nation goes private. Lagos to London transfers in milliseconds, not days. Your money, your control.</p>
          <div class="culture-symbols">🥁 🌴 ✊</div>
        </div>

        <div class="citizen-card culture-brazil">
          <div class="culture-bar"></div>
          <div class="citizen-flag">🇧🇷</div>
          <h3>Brazil</h3>
          <p class="culture-tagline">From the Amazon to the blockchain</p>
          <p>A nation that invented Pix instant payments deserves private instant payments. OST brings financial freedom to 215 million Brazilians.</p>
          <div class="culture-symbols">☕ 🎶 🌿</div>
        </div>

        <div class="citizen-card culture-mexico">
          <div class="culture-bar"></div>
          <div class="citizen-flag">🇲🇽</div>
          <h3>Mexico</h3>
          <p class="culture-tagline">Bridging two continents</p>
          <p>Remittances from the US shouldn't take 3 days and 8% fees. OST makes cross-border family support instant, private, and nearly free.</p>
          <div class="culture-symbols">🌮 🎸 🦅</div>
        </div>

        <div class="citizen-card culture-russia">
          <div class="culture-bar"></div>
          <div class="citizen-flag">🇷🇺</div>
          <h3>Russia</h3>
          <p class="culture-tagline">From Moscow to the digital frontier</p>
          <p>When traditional banking fails you, you don't stop — you innovate. OST works regardless of politics, sanctions, or borders.</p>
          <div class="culture-symbols">🏔️ 🎭 ❄️</div>
        </div>

        <div class="citizen-card culture-iran">
          <div class="culture-bar"></div>
          <div class="citizen-flag">🇮🇷</div>
          <h3>Iran</h3>
          <p class="culture-tagline">Ancient Persia, digital future</p>
          <p>The cradle of civilization doesn't need permission to trade. OST connects Iran's brilliant minds to the global economy — permissionlessly.</p>
          <div class="culture-symbols">🌹 📜 🕌</div>
        </div>

        <div class="citizen-card culture-indonesia">
          <div class="culture-bar"></div>
          <div class="citizen-flag">🇮🇩</div>
          <h3>Indonesia</h3>
          <p class="culture-tagline">17,000 islands, one currency</p>
          <p>Connecting the world's largest archipelago with digital cash that works even without internet. Island to island, neighbor to neighbor.</p>
          <div class="culture-symbols">🌺 🏝️ 🎭</div>
        </div>

        <div class="citizen-card culture-turkey">
          <div class="culture-bar"></div>
          <div class="citizen-flag">🇹🇷</div>
          <h3>Turkey</h3>
          <p class="culture-tagline">Where East meets West</p>
          <p>Istanbul has bridged continents for millennia. OST bridges your lira to a world of private, inflation-proof digital cash.</p>
          <div class="culture-symbols">🕌 🧿 🌙</div>
        </div>

        <div class="citizen-card culture-egypt">
          <div class="culture-bar"></div>
          <div class="citizen-flag">🇪🇬</div>
          <h3>Egypt</h3>
          <p class="culture-tagline">Civilization renewed</p>
          <p>The builders of the pyramids built for eternity. OST builds permanent financial sovereignty for every Egyptian.</p>
          <div class="culture-symbols">🏛️ ☀️ 🐫</div>
        </div>

        <div class="citizen-card culture-japan">
          <div class="culture-bar"></div>
          <div class="citizen-flag">🇯🇵</div>
          <h3>Japan</h3>
          <p class="culture-tagline">Precision meets privacy</p>
          <p>The nation that pioneered digital culture gets the digital cash it deserves — fast, private, and beautiful in its simplicity.</p>
          <div class="culture-symbols">🗾 🌸 ⛩️</div>
        </div>

        <div class="citizen-card culture-kenya">
          <div class="culture-bar"></div>
          <div class="citizen-flag">🇰🇪</div>
          <h3>Kenya</h3>
          <p class="culture-tagline">Mobile money reborn</p>
          <p>Kenya invented M-Pesa and changed the world. OST is the next evolution — private, borderless, and truly yours.</p>
          <div class="culture-symbols">🦁 🌍 📱</div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================================================================== -->
  <!-- 4. THE REVOLUTIONARY NEXT STEP — Features + Pay Demo -->
  <!-- ================================================================== -->
  <section id="revolution" class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title">The Revolutionary Next Step</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        Not just another token. A complete financial system designed for real life.
      </p>

      <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="feature-card glow-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">🔐</div>
          <h3>Confidential Transfers</h3>
          <p>Zero-knowledge proofs hide your balance and every transaction. Not even validators see your amounts.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card glow-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">⚡</div>
          <h3>Sub-Second Settlement</h3>
          <p>400ms on Solana. Faster than tapping your card. Faster than counting banknotes.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card glow-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">🌍</div>
          <h3>Any-to-OST Bridge</h3>
          <p>Bitcoin, Ethereum, USDC, bank transfers — everything converts into private OST in one flow.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card glow-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">🏛️</div>
          <h3>DAO Treasury</h3>
          <p>0.1% fee funds satellite infrastructure. Every disbursement voted on-chain by stakers.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card glow-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">📡</div>
          <h3>Offline Payments</h3>
          <p>NFC, QR, Bluetooth. Pay without internet. Settle when you reconnect — minutes or months later.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card glow-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">🛡️</div>
          <h3>ZK Tax Compliance</h3>
          <p>Prove your tax obligations without revealing your balance. Privacy and compliance, together.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- COMPLEX PAY DEMO — Mini Store -->
      <div class="pay-demo" id="pay-demo">
        <h3>Experience Private Payments</h3>
        <p class="pay-demo-sub">Pick items, build your cart, and feel what shopping with OST is like.</p>
        
        <div class="store-products" id="storeProducts">
          <div class="store-item" data-price="0.50" data-name="Morning Coffee" data-emoji="☕">
            <div class="item-visual">☕</div>
            <div class="item-details">
              <span class="item-name">Morning Coffee</span>
              <span class="item-price">0.50 OST</span>
            </div>
            <button class="btn-add" aria-label="Add to cart">+</button>
          </div>
          <div class="store-item" data-price="3.20" data-name="Street Tacos" data-emoji="🌮">
            <div class="item-visual">🌮</div>
            <div class="item-details">
              <span class="item-name">Street Tacos</span>
              <span class="item-price">3.20 OST</span>
            </div>
            <button class="btn-add" aria-label="Add to cart">+</button>
          </div>
          <div class="store-item" data-price="15.00" data-name="T-Shirt" data-emoji="👕">
            <div class="item-visual">👕</div>
            <div class="item-details">
              <span class="item-name">T-Shirt</span>
              <span class="item-price">15.00 OST</span>
            </div>
            <button class="btn-add" aria-label="Add to cart">+</button>
          </div>
          <div class="store-item" data-price="85.00" data-name="Weekly Groceries" data-emoji="🛒">
            <div class="item-visual">🛒</div>
            <div class="item-details">
              <span class="item-name">Weekly Groceries</span>
              <span class="item-price">85.00 OST</span>
            </div>
            <button class="btn-add" aria-label="Add to cart">+</button>
          </div>
          <div class="store-item" data-price="250.00" data-name="Flight Ticket" data-emoji="✈️">
            <div class="item-visual">✈️</div>
            <div class="item-details">
              <span class="item-name">Flight Ticket</span>
              <span class="item-price">250.00 OST</span>
            </div>
            <button class="btn-add" aria-label="Add to cart">+</button>
          </div>
          <div class="store-item" data-price="1200.00" data-name="Laptop" data-emoji="💻">
            <div class="item-visual">💻</div>
            <div class="item-details">
              <span class="item-name">Laptop</span>
              <span class="item-price">1,200.00 OST</span>
            </div>
            <button class="btn-add" aria-label="Add to cart">+</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="store-cart" id="storeCart">
          <div class="cart-header">
            <span class="cart-icon">🛍️</span>
            <span class="cart-title">Your Cart</span>
            <span class="cart-badge" id="cartBadge">0</span>
          </div>
          <div class="cart-items" id="cartItems">
            <p class="cart-empty">Tap + to add items</p>
          </div>
          <div class="cart-footer">
            <div class="cart-total">
              <span>Total</span>
              <span class="cart-total-amount" id="cartTotal">0.00 OST</span>
            </div>
            <button class="btn btn-primary btn-pay" id="payBtn" disabled>
              <span class="pay-icon">◉</span> Pay with OST
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Payment progress overlay -->
        <div class="pay-overlay" id="payOverlay">
          <div class="pay-progress">
            <div class="pay-step" data-step="1">
              <div class="step-ring"><div class="step-check">🔐</div></div>
              <span>Connecting wallet</span>
            </div>
            <div class="pay-connector"></div>
            <div class="pay-step" data-step="2">
              <div class="step-ring"><div class="step-check">🧮</div></div>
              <span>Generating ZK proof</span>
            </div>
            <div class="pay-connector"></div>
            <div class="pay-step" data-step="3">
              <div class="step-ring"><div class="step-check">📡</div></div>
              <span>Broadcasting transfer</span>
            </div>
            <div class="pay-connector"></div>
            <div class="pay-step" data-step="4">
              <div class="step-ring"><div class="step-check">✅</div></div>
              <span>Confirmed in 0.4s</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="pay-receipt" id="payReceipt">
            <div class="receipt-emoji">🎉</div>
            <p class="receipt-text">Payment Complete — Fully Private</p>
            <p class="receipt-sub">No one on Earth saw this transaction.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================================================================== -->
  <!-- 5. TRANSFER — Integrated Flow -->
  <!-- ================================================================== -->
  <section id="transfer" class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title">Bring Your Money From Anywhere</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        Any crypto, any fiat, any chain. Everything flows into OST — 
        privately, instantly, right here.
      </p>

      <!-- Integrated Transfer Widget -->
      <div class="transfer-widget">
        <div class="transfer-visual">
          <div class="transfer-flow-line"></div>

          <div class="transfer-node node-source">
            <div class="node-icon">💰</div>
            <div class="node-label">Your Currency</div>
            <select class="transfer-select" id="transferFrom">
              <option value="BTC">Bitcoin (BTC)</option>
              <option value="ETH">Ethereum (ETH)</option>
              <option value="USDC">USDC</option>
              <option value="SOL">Solana (SOL)</option>
              <option value="USDT">Tether (USDT)</option>
              <option value="BNB">BNB Chain</option>
              <option value="MATIC">Polygon (MATIC)</option>
              <option value="USD">US Dollar</option>
              <option value="EUR">Euro</option>
              <option value="GBP">British Pound</option>
              <option value="CNY">Chinese Yuan</option>
              <option value="INR">Indian Rupee</option>
              <option value="BRL">Brazilian Real</option>
              <option value="RUB">Russian Ruble</option>
              <option value="NGN">Nigerian Naira</option>
              <option value="MXN">Mexican Peso</option>
            </select>
            <input type="number" class="transfer-amount" id="transferAmount" placeholder="Amount" min="0" step="any">
          </div>

          <div class="transfer-node node-process">
            <div class="process-steps">
              <div class="process-step" id="pStep1">
                <span class="process-dot"></span>
                <span>Bridge to Solana</span>
              </div>
              <div class="process-step" id="pStep2">
                <span class="process-dot"></span>
                <span>Swap to OST</span>
              </div>
              <div class="process-step" id="pStep3">
                <span class="process-dot"></span>
                <span>Deposit to Private</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="transfer-node node-dest">
            <div class="node-icon">◉</div>
            <div class="node-label">Confidential OST</div>
            <div class="node-result">Private &amp; Instant</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <button class="btn btn-primary btn-glow" id="transferBtn" style="margin-top:32px;">
          Convert to OST →
        </button>
        <p class="transfer-note">
          Powered by Wormhole, Jupiter Aggregator, and Solana Token-2022. Demo mode — connect wallet for live transfers.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Fiat On-Ramp -->
      <div class="fiat-ramp">
        <h3>Coming from Fiat?</h3>
        <p>
          Use <strong>MoonPay</strong>, <strong>Transak</strong>, or <strong>Ramp Network</strong> — 
          available in 100+ countries. Buy SOL or USDC with card or bank transfer, then convert 
          above. Under 5 minutes to private digital cash.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================================================================== -->
  <!-- 6. OFFLINE CASH ANYWHERE -->
  <!-- ================================================================== -->
  <section id="offline" class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title">Offline Cash Anywhere</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        The internet isn't everywhere yet. But your money should be.
        OST works without WiFi, cell signal, or satellites.
      </p>

      <div class="manifesto">
        <p class="manifesto-lead">
          Transactions at the speed of light — even when the lights are off.
        </p>
        <p>
          Imagine handing someone a banknote. No bank involved. No internet needed.
          Just two people and a piece of value changing hands. OST brings that exact 
          feeling to the digital world — and it works offline.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="offline-grid">
        <div class="offline-card glow-card">
          <div class="offline-icon-wrap">
            <div class="offline-icon">📱</div>
            <div class="offline-pulse"></div>
          </div>
          <h3>NFC Tap-to-Pay</h3>
          <p>Hold your phone near theirs. One tap. Payment transferred. Like Apple Pay — but private, borderless, and without a bank between you.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="offline-card glow-card">
          <div class="offline-icon-wrap">
            <div class="offline-icon">📷</div>
            <div class="offline-pulse"></div>
          </div>
          <h3>QR Code Scan</h3>
          <p>The signed payment fits in a single QR code (~2 KB). Show it, print it, etch it on metal — the receiver scans and has verified OST.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="offline-card glow-card">
          <div class="offline-icon-wrap">
            <div class="offline-icon">📡</div>
            <div class="offline-pulse"></div>
          </div>
          <h3>Bluetooth Nearby</h3>
          <p>Bluetooth Low Energy beams the transaction up to 30 feet. Perfect for markets, classrooms, or across the dinner table.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="manifesto" style="margin-top:48px;">
        <h3 style="color:#fff;font-size:1.3rem;margin-bottom:16px;">Cash In / Cash Out — No Internet Required</h3>
        <p>
          <strong>Cash in:</strong> Walk up to any OST cash agent — a corner store, a friend. 
          Hand them physical money. They tap an NFC bearer note. You hold OST. Redeem on-chain 
          whenever you get online.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Cash out:</strong> Create a bearer note, show the QR to a cash agent. 
          Agent scans, hands you bills. No bank, no form, no delay.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>P2P exchange:</strong> You have BTC on Lightning. Your friend has OST bearer 
          notes. You send sats; they tap you an NFC note. No exchange, no KYC. 
          Peer-to-peer, the way it was always meant to be.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

