  <section id="ai" class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title">Power for Every Intelligence</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        OST doesn't just serve humans. We welcome AI agents, autonomous systems, bots, 
        servers, assistants, and every form of digital intelligence. If you can compute, 
        you can transact.
      </p>

      <div class="ai-hero-visual">
        <div class="ai-orb" id="aiOrb">
          <div class="ai-ring ai-ring-1"></div>
          <div class="ai-ring ai-ring-2"></div>
          <div class="ai-ring ai-ring-3"></div>
