        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="feature-card glow-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">🤖</div>
          <h3>AI Agents</h3>
          <p>Autonomous agents can hold, send, and receive OST. Build payment flows for AI services, tip bots, and automated workflows.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card glow-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">🔌</div>
          <h3>API-First</h3>
          <p>REST endpoints, WebSocket feeds, TypeScript SDK. Integrate OST payments into any system in minutes.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card glow-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">🖥️</div>
          <h3>Server-to-Server</h3>
          <p>Machine-to-machine payments at Solana speed. IoT devices, cloud services, autonomous vehicles — all welcome.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card glow-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">🧠</div>
          <h3>Smart Assistants</h3>
          <p>Let your AI assistant manage payments. Delegate spending limits, automate recurring transfers, handle bills.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card glow-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">🔗</div>
          <h3>MCP &amp; Tool Use</h3>
          <p>Compatible with Model Context Protocol, function calling, and tool-use patterns. Your AI talks to OST natively.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card glow-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">🛡️</div>
          <h3>Privacy for Machines Too</h3>
          <p>Confidential transfers protect AI agents the same way they protect humans. No surveillance on anyone — carbon or silicon.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="manifesto" style="margin-top:40px;">
        <p class="manifesto-lead">
          In the future, most transactions will be machine-to-machine. We're ready today.
        </p>
        <p>
          We don't draw lines between humans and AI. An intelligence that can create value 
          deserves to exchange value. OST is the currency that doesn't discriminate — 
          by nation, by species, or by substrate.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

