  <!-- ================================================================== -->
  <!-- 10. TRANSPARENCY -->
  <!-- ================================================================== -->
  <section id="transparency" class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title">Why OST Is Not a Scam — Full Transparency</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        You've been lied to by too many projects. We understand.
        Here is everything, laid bare. Verify it all yourself.
      </p>

      <div class="manifesto">
        <p class="manifesto-lead">
          Trust is earned with facts, not promises.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>No pre-mine. No hidden allocations. No "team tokens."</strong><br>
          Every single token was minted through the public, auditable <code>confidential_mint</code> 
          instruction. No secret wallets, no locked vesting for insiders.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Open source from day one.</strong><br>
          Every line of Rust, TypeScript, and HTML — all on GitHub. Read the code yourself. 
          Find a flaw? Open a PR. Find something shady? Tell the world.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Real company, real founder, real jurisdiction.</strong><br>
          OST is operated through a Panama S.A. The founder is a builder from Mexico — 
          not anonymous, not hiding. Company docs are public.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>The space story is real.</strong><br>
          The 0.1% DAO fee flows into a transparent, on-chain treasury governed by stakers.
          Every disbursement is voted on publicly. The satellites aren't a metaphor — 
          they're a budget line.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>What we believe:</strong><br>
          We are all brothers and sisters. Borders are lines on maps drawn by power;
          they don't exist in our hearts. OST is a tool that lets us trade freely and 
          privately, the way humans were always meant to.
        </p>
        <p class="manifesto-closing">Read the code. Check the company. Verify the treasury.<br><strong>Then decide for yourself.</strong></p>
      </div>

      <div class="verify-grid">
        <div class="feature-card glow-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">📂</div>
          <h3>GitHub Repository</h3>
          <p>Full source: Anchor program, client SDK, website, deploy scripts. MIT licensed.</p>
          <a href="https://github.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-outline" style="margin-top:12px;">View on GitHub →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card glow-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">🏛️</div>
          <h3>Panama Company Docs</h3>
          <p>S.A. registration, articles, and public filings. All verifiable.</p>
          <a href="#" class="btn btn-outline" style="margin-top:12px;">View Docs →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card glow-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">🔍</div>
          <h3>On-Chain Treasury</h3>
          <p>Every fee, every vote, every disbursement — transparent on Solana Explorer.</p>
          <a href="#" class="btn btn-outline" style="margin-top:12px;">View Treasury →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

